0027:     - If the hollow-frame positions spread more by column than row, pack left-to-right ordered by column; otherwise pack top-to-bottom ordered by row.
0028:     Key insight
0029:     - The solid blocks are distractors; the hollow frames are the retained sprites, and their dominant layout axis determines the output strip.
